---
import Scroll from "./Scroll.astro";
import Bio from "./Bio.astro";
---

<section id="about">
	<a href="#" class="top">top</a>
	<Bio />
	<article class="about">
		<p>
			We all lose sight of the opportunity sometimes. Thoughts and
			discussions spiral through a maze of competing solutions,
			requirements, and constraints.
		</p>
		<p>
			The day-to-day likely prevails, and short-term wins are celebrated.
			Systems become legendary. Everyone knows them by name; many regard
			them as heritage; few know how they work.
		</p>
		<p>
			That's where I step in, quietly and focused. You'll notice the
			results. Here is how.
		</p>
	</article>

	<div class="pillars">
		<article class="pillar_1">
			<h2><span>01.</span>Listen</h2>
			<p>
				Innovation starts with understanding your team, not just your
				tech stack.
			</p>
		</article>
		<article class="pillar_2">
			<h2><span>02.</span>Simplify</h2>
			<p>
				Together, we strip away the unnecessary to create systems that
				feel natural to use.
			</p>
		</article>
		<article class="pillar_3">
			<h2><span>03.</span>Deliver</h2>
			<p>
				Real-world impact is the only metric that matters for long-term
				success.
			</p>
		</article>
	</div>
	<div class="scroll-container">
		<Scroll />
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about {
		grid-column: 2 / span 9;
		grid-row: 2;
		padding-top: 0;
	}

	.pillars {
		grid-column: 2 / span 9;
		grid-row: 3;

		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 4rem;
	}

	.pillar_1,
	.pillar_2,
	.pillar_3 {
		flex: 1 1 0;
		min-width: 0;
	}

	/* Below this width the pillar columns get too narrow for their
	   titles, forcing a mid-word break, so stack the pillars instead. */
	@media screen and (max-width: 1153px) {
		.pillars {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: stretch;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	@media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
		.about {
			grid-column: 1 / span 12;
		}

		.pillars {
			grid-column: 1 / span 12;
		}
	}
</style>
